@startuml
actor User
participant "User Interface" as UI
participant "File Manager" as FM
participant "Header Manager" as HM
participant "Huffman Tree" as HT
participant "Decompressor" as DE

User -> UI : Select compressed file
UI -> FM : Open archive
FM -> HM : Read and validate header
HM -> HT : Provide tree information
HT --> DE : Reconstructed tree
DE -> FM : Write restored data
FM --> UI : Completion status
UI --> User : Show result
@enduml
